ith no hidden surprises—everything was transparent and professional. The entire process of buying and selling was smooth from start to finish.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#689F38"},{name:"Aakash Bhatia",date:"",review:"The staff's behavior and after-sales service are truly amazing and professional. Totally a satisfying experience; I highly recommend buying your next car here.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#7E57C2"},{name:"Nishant Kumar",date:"",review:"Best-in-class quality and phenomenal work on my BMW 3 Series. The smooth process and delivery made for a very happy and satisfied experience.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#EC407A"},{name:"Ram S Chowdhary",date:"",review:"Our pre-owned car looks and feels brand new—luxurious and comfortable. Their transparent approach and genuine recommendations made the process stress-free.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#78909C"},{name:"Sunny Kochar ",date:"",review:"A truly seamless and highly professional experience from start to finish. The team was incredibly supportive and ensured the entire deal went perfectly.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#F4511E"},{name:"Darshan Mistry",date:"",review:"Their passion and crystal-clear communication transformed our car into a customized beauty. They delivered beyond expectations and created a true 'Wow' moment for us.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#0097A7"},{name:"Venkata C Muthoju",date:"",review:"An exceptional experience with professional communication and unparalleled support. Their customer-centric approach is truly unmatched in the automotive industry.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#689F38"},{name:"VK Nayak",date:"",review:"Professional, knowledgeable, and never pushy—the process was incredibly smooth. I left feeling completely confident in my purchase and the team’s expertise.",stars:5,avatarColor:"#7E57C2"}],"videoTestimonials",0,[{video:"/videos/testimonials/1.mp4",thumbnail:"/videos/testimonials/1.webp",name:"Mr. Rajat Tandon",designation:"BMW M340i"},{video:"/videos/testimonials/2.mp4",thumbnail:"/videos/testimonials/2.webp",name:"⁠Mrs. Kakkar",designation:"BMW i4"},{video:"/videos/testimonials/3.mp4",thumbnail:"/videos/testimonials/3.webp",name:"Mrs. & Mr. Ahluwalia",designation:"Nissan X-Trail"},{video:"/videos/testimonials/4.mp4",thumbnail:"/videos/testimonials/4.webp",name:"Mr. Pranav Mehra",designation:"Nissan X-Trail"},{video:"/videos/testimonials/5.mp4",thumbnail:"/videos/testimonials/5.webp",name:"Mr. Sampann Khungar",designation:"Mercedes Benz C200 "},{video:"/videos/testimonials/6.mp4",thumbnail:"/videos/testimonials/6.webp",name:"Mr. Gurdev Kalsi",designation:"BMW 330Li LCI M sport"}],"writtenReviews",0,[{avatar:"/images/testimonials/written-review-avatar-1.webp",name:"Prince Narula",designation:"Actor",review:"David visited our showroom unsure of what to choose. Our team guided him with clear explanations and personalized suggestions. After installation, he loved the smooth performance and quick support. Today, he confidently recommends us, calling the entire experience simple, reliable, and genuinely satisfying."},{avatar:"/images/testimonials/written-review-avatar-2.webp",name:"John Abraham",designation:"Actor",review:"David visited our showroom unsure of what to choose. Our team guided him with clear explanations and personalized suggestions. After installation, he loved the smooth performance and quick support. Today, he confidently recommends us, calling the entire experience simple, reliable, and genuinely satisfying."},{avatar:"/images/testimonials/written-review-avatar-3.webp",name:"Yuvika Chaudhary",designation:"Actor",review:"David visited our showroom unsure of what to choose. Our team guided him with clear explanations and personalized suggestions. After installation, he loved the smooth performance and quick support. Today, he confidently recommends us, calling the entire experience simple, reliable, and genuinely satisfying."},{avatar:"/images/testimonials/written-review-avatar-4.webp",name:"Neha Dhupia",designation:"Actor",review:"David visited our showroom unsure of wh